  "body": "This is a pretty easy bug to fix. In HTMLInputElement-impl.js's _activationBehavior, we make input and change events cancelable. They should not be, per spec:\r\n\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#checkbox-state-(type=checkbox):input-activation-behavior\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#radio-button-state-(type=radio):input-activation-behavior\r\n\r\nThis will require finding or writing web platform tests, and also ensuring that the spec matches browsers in this regard.",
